# Service Setup Checklist
RULE: Follow complete setup workflow for new services using ServiceCLI framework. Services are pure orchestrators that delegate to unified libraries.
WHY: Ensures consistent service structure using ServiceCLI and prevents business logic in services.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/service-setup-checklist.md
DO: Use ServiceCLI from unified_trading_services.core.service_framework; create BaseModeHandler implementations; delegate to unified libraries; update dependency chain
NEVER: Skip event logging tests; implement business logic in services; skip dependency chain updates; create custom CLI (use ServiceCLI)
